    "text": "By Jayla Howard ,\n1 days ago TALLAHASSEE, Fla. -- What began as a high-energy Easter egg drop that drew thousands of people quickly turned tense when a child ran into the drop zone just as eggs were falling from above. A volunteer at Immanuel Baptist Church had a quick reaction, ensuring the moment ended safely. More... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
